cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it, and cite the work it is built on: the FEFF references in every case, the
  EvAX references when you use the reverse Monte Carlo tools (feffgpu.rmc). The list is below and in README.md.
title: "feffgpu: FEFF 8.5L's EXAFS pipeline on NVIDIA GPUs, with MD-EXAFS and RMC-EXAFS"
